eveloper.'),(3962,623,'rating','5'),(3963,624,'reviewer_meta','Medical Officer · Damansara Jaya, PJ'),(3964,624,'title_en','Perfect for hospital on-call duties'),(3965,624,'title_ms','Perfect for hospital on-call duties'),(3966,624,'body_en','Working 24-hour calls at a government hospital is mentally exhausting. Modvigil keeps me alert and focused without the jitteriness of energy drinks. Arrived in PJ within 9 days, packaged so discreetly nobody would know what it is.'),(3967,624,'body_ms','Working 24-hour calls at a government hospital is mentally exhausting. Modvigil keeps me alert and focused without the jitteriness of energy drinks. Arrived in PJ within 9 days, packaged so discreetly nobody would know what it is.'),(3968,624,'rating','5'),(3969,625,'reviewer_meta','UiTM Final Year Engineering · Shah Alam, Selangor'),(3970,625,'title_en','Peperiksaan akhir tahun selamat!'),(3971,625,'title_ms','Peperiksaan akhir tahun selamat!'),(3972,625,'body_en','Final year dengan 6 exam dalam seminggu memang mencabar. Dengan Modvigil 200mg saya dapat study 10 jam sehari tanpa mengantuk. Lulus semua dengan jayanya. ModafinilMY recommended!'),(3973,625,'body_ms','Final year dengan 6 exam dalam seminggu memang mencabar. Dengan Modvigil 200mg saya dapat study 10 jam sehari tanpa mengantuk. Lulus semua dengan jayanya. ModafinilMY recommended!'),(3974,625,'rating','5'),(3975,626,'reviewer_meta','Marketing Manager (Startup) · SS15, Subang Jaya'),(3976,626,'title_en','No more 3PM brain crash'),(3977,626,'title_ms','No more 3PM brain crash'),(3978,626,'body_en','I used to crash every afternoon and rely on 3-4 coffees a day. Modalert gives me clean, sustained focus from 8am to 7pm. Delivery to Subang Jaya was fast and the customer support via WhatsApp is excellent.'),(3979,626,'body_ms','I used to crash every afternoon and rely on 3-4 coffees a day. Modalert gives me clean, sustained focus from 8am to 7pm. Delivery to Subang Jaya was fast and the customer support via WhatsApp is excellent.'),(3980,626,'rating','5'),(3981,627,'reviewer_meta','Senior Accountant · George Town, Penang'),(3982,627,'title_en','Survived the busiest quarter ever'),(3983,627,'title_ms','Survived the busiest quarter ever'),(3984,627,'body_en','Year-end closing at a manufacturing firm means insane hours. Modvigil helped me stay mentally sharp through 60-hour weeks. Arrived in Penang in 10 days — worth every ringgit.'),(3985,627,'body_ms','Year-end closing at a manufacturing firm means insane hours. Modvigil helped me stay mentally sharp through 60-hour weeks. Arrived in Penang in 10 days — worth every ringgit.'),(3986,627,'rating','5'),(3987,628,'reviewer_meta','Cross-border Business Consultant · Johor Bahru'),(3988,628,'title_en','Essential for JB-SG commuters'),(3989,628,'title_ms','Essential for JB-SG commuters'),(3990,628,'body_en','Commuting between JB and Singapore daily is tiring. Modalert keeps me sharp for back-to-back client meetings. Delivery to JB was fast and the pricing is very reasonable compared to what I\'ve seen elsewhere.'),(3991,628,'body_ms','Commuting between JB and Singapore daily is tiring. Modalert keeps me sharp for back-to-back client meetings. Delivery to JB was fast and the pricing is very reasonable compared to what I\'ve seen elsewhere.'),(3992,628,'rating','5'),(3993,629,'reviewer_meta','Medical Officer (USM) · Kota Bharu, Kelantan'),(3994,629,'title_en','Helps me through long hospital shifts'),(3995,629,'title_ms','Helps me through long hospital shifts'),(3996,629,'body_en','As a medical officer covering night shifts at a busy hospital, staying alert is critical. Modafinil genuinely helps me remain sharp and make good clinical decisions at 4am. Delivery to Kota Bharu took 12 days — acceptable.'),(3997,629,'body_ms','As a medical officer covering night shifts at a busy hospital, staying alert is critical. Modafinil genuinely helps me remain sharp and make good clinical decisions at 4am. Delivery to Kota Bharu took 12 days — acceptable.'),(39