7,'modules_0_cta_desc_ms','Pasukan kami berbahasa Malaysia dan English, sedia membantu 7 hari seminggu.'),(4197,667,'_modules_0_cta_desc_ms','field_faq_22e0690fb2af'),(4198,667,'modules_0_cta_btn_text_en','WhatsApp Us Now'),(4199,667,'_modules_0_cta_btn_text_en','field_faq_5db0c02a932d'),(4200,667,'modules_0_cta_btn_text_ms','WhatsApp Kami Sekarang'),(4201,667,'_modules_0_cta_btn_text_ms','field_faq_073f8d408a6b'),(4202,667,'modules_0_cta_btn_link','https://wa.me/601116284532'),(4203,667,'_modules_0_cta_btn_link','field_faq_dc6de8b02bb6'),(4204,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_title_en','Legal Status'),(4205,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_title_en','field_faq_cat_title_en'),(4206,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_title_ms','Status Undang-Undang'),(4207,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_title_ms','field_faq_cat_title_ms'),(4208,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_question_en','Is Modafinil legal in Malaysia?'),(4209,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4210,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_question_ms','Adakah Modafinil sah di Malaysia?'),(4211,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4212,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_answer_en','Modafinil is a prescription medication in Malaysia under the Poisons Act 1952. It is not a narcotic or heavily controlled substance under the Dangerous Drugs Act. Personal possession for own use is generally not actively enforced, but you should consult a doctor first.'),(4213,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4214,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_answer_ms','Modafinil adalah ubat preskripsi di Malaysia di bawah Akta Racun 1952. Ia bukan ubat narkotik atau bahan terkawal di bawah Akta Dadah Berbahaya. Pemilikan peribadi untuk kegunaan peribadi umumnya tidak dikuatkuasakan, tetapi anda harus mendapatkan nasihat doktor terlebih dahulu.'),(4215,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_0_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4216,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_question_en','Can I import Modafinil into Malaysia from overseas?'),(4217,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4218,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_question_ms','Bolehkah saya import Modafinil ke Malaysia dari luar negara?'),(4219,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4220,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_answer_en','Small quantities for personal use are usually allowed through Malaysian customs. Our orders are shipped in discreet packaging. However, we recommend keeping a record and consulting a medical practitioner.'),(4221,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4222,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_answer_ms','Kuantiti kecil untuk kegunaan peribadi lazimnya dibenarkan masuk oleh kastam Malaysia. Pesanan kami dihantar dalam pembungkusan diskret. Walau bagaimanapun, kami mengesyorkan anda menyimpan rekod dan berunding dengan pengamal perubatan.'),(4223,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_1_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4224,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_question_en','Is Modafinil an illicit drug?'),(4225,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4226,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_question_ms','Adakah Modafinil sama dengan dadah terlarang?'),(4227,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4228,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_answer_en','No. Modafinil is not an amphetamine and is not a controlled substance in Malaysia. It is vastly different from street drugs. It is a wakefulness-promoting agent used clinically to treat narcolepsy, sleep apnea, and shift work disorder.'),(4229,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4230,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_answer_ms','Tidak. Modafinil bukan amfetamin dan bukan bahan terkawal di Malaysia. Ia jauh berbeza daripada dadah jalanan. Ia adalah agen yang menggalakkan keberjagaan (wakefulness-promoting agent) yang digunakan secara klinikal untuk merawat narcolepsy, sleep apnea, dan shift work disorder.'),(4231,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items_2_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4232,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_0_items','3'),(4233,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_0_items','field_faq_cat_items'),(4234,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_title_en','Delivery'),(4235,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_title_en','field_faq_cat_title_en'),(4236,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_title_ms','Penghantaran'),(4237,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_title_ms','field_faq_cat_title_ms'),(4238,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_question_en','How long does shipping to Malaysia take?'),(4239,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4240,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_question_ms','Berapa lama penghantaran ke Malaysia?'),(4241,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4242,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_answer_en','Shipping to Peninsular Malaysia takes 7-12 working days. Sabah and Sarawak takes 10-16 working days. All orders are shipped via Pos Malaysia with a tracking number.'),(4243,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4244,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_answer_ms','Penghantaran ke Semenanjung Malaysia mengambil 7-12 hari bekerja. Sabah dan Sarawak mengambil 10-16 hari bekerja. Semua pesanan dihantar via Pos Malaysia dengan nombor penjejakan.'),(4245,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_0_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4246,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_question_en','Is shipping free?'),(4247,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4248,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_question_ms','Adakah penghantaran percuma?'),(4249,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4250,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_answer_en','Yes — free shipping for all orders RM399 and above. Orders below RM399 incur a standard shipping fee via Pos Malaysia.'),(4251,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4252,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_answer_ms','Ya — penghantaran percuma untuk semua pesanan RM399 ke atas. Pesanan di bawah RM399 dikenakan caj penghantaran standard via Pos Malaysia.'),(4253,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_1_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4254,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_question_en','How do I track my order?'),(4255,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4256,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_question_ms','Bagaimana saya menjejak pesanan saya?'),(4257,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4258,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_answer_en','After shipping, you will receive a Pos Malaysia tracking number. You can track the order on the official Pos Malaysia website or through our order tracking page.'),(4259,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4260,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_answer_ms','Selepas penghantaran, anda akan menerima nombor penjejakan Pos Malaysia. Anda boleh menjejak pesanan di laman web rasmi Pos Malaysia atau melalui halaman jejak pesanan kami.'),(4261,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_2_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4262,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_question_en','Is the packaging discreet?'),(4263,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4264,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_question_ms','Adakah pembungkusan diskret?'),(4265,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4266,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_answer_en','Yes, completely. All orders are shipped in plain boxes without any branding, product names, or information indicating the contents. The sender name on the label is a generic business name.'),(4267,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4268,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_answer_ms','Ya, sepenuhnya. Semua pesanan dihantar dalam kotak biasa tanpa sebarang jenama, nama produk, atau maklumat yang menunjukkan kandungannya. Nama penghantar pada label adalah nama generik perniagaan sahaja.'),(4269,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_3_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4270,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_question_en','Do you ship to Sabah and Sarawak?'),(4271,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4272,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_question_ms','Adakah anda hantar ke Sabah dan Sarawak?'),(4273,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4274,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_answer_en','Yes. We ship to all areas of Malaysia including Sabah, Sarawak, Labuan, and all Malaysian islands. Delivery time to East Malaysia is 10-16 working days.'),(4275,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4276,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_answer_ms','Ya. Kami menghantar ke semua kawasan Malaysia termasuk Sabah, Sarawak, Labuan, dan semua pulau di Malaysia. Masa penghantaran ke Malaysia Timur adalah 10-16 hari bekerja.'),(4277,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items_4_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4278,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_1_items','5'),(4279,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_1_items','field_faq_cat_items'),(4280,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_title_en','Payment'),(4281,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_title_en','field_faq_cat_title_en'),(4282,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_title_ms','Pembayaran'),(4283,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_title_ms','field_faq_cat_title_ms'),(4284,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_question_en','What payment methods are accepted?'),(4285,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4286,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_question_ms','Apakah kaedah pembayaran yang diterima?'),(4287,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4288,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_answer_en','We accept bank transfers (Maybank, CIMB, Public Bank, RHB, etc.) and FPX/online banking. We do not accept credit cards or PayPal at this time.'),(4289,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4290,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_answer_ms','Kami menerima pindahan bank (Maybank, CIMB, Public Bank, RHB, dll.) dan FPX/online banking. Kami tidak menerima kad kredit atau PayPal buat masa ini.'),(4291,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_0_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4292,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_question_en','What currency do I pay in?'),(4293,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4294,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_question_ms','Dalam mata wang apa saya perlu bayar?'),(4295,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4296,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_answer_en','All payments are in Malaysian Ringgit (RM). There are no foreign exchange fees.'),(4297,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4298,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_answer_ms','Semua pembayaran dalam Ringgit Malaysia (RM). Tiada yuran tukar wang asing.'),(4299,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_1_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4300,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_question_en','How long does payment take to process?'),(4301,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4302,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_question_ms','Berapa lama untuk pembayaran diproses?'),(4303,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4304,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_answer_en','After you submit proof of payment, orders are processed within 24 hours on working days.'),(4305,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4306,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_answer_ms','Selepas anda menghantar bukti pembayaran, pesanan akan diproses dalam masa 24 jam pada hari bekerja.'),(4307,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items_2_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4308,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_2_items','3'),(4309,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_2_items','field_faq_cat_items'),(4310,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_title_en','Products'),(4311,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_title_en','field_faq_cat_title_en'),(4312,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_title_ms','Produk'),(4313,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_title_ms','field_faq_cat_title_ms'),(4314,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_question_en','What is the difference between Modalert and Modvigil?'),(4315,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4316,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_question_ms','Apa perbezaan antara Modalert dan Modvigil?'),(4317,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4318,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_answer_en','Both contain 200mg Modafinil but from different manufacturers. Modalert (Sun Pharma) is usually stronger with a faster onset. Modvigil (HAB Pharma) is smoother and more suitable for new users or those sensitive to stimulants.'),(4319,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4320,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_answer_ms','Kedua-duanya mengandungi Modafinil 200mg tetapi dari pengeluar yang berbeza. Modalert (Sun Pharma) biasanya lebih kuat dengan permulaan lebih cepat. Modvigil (HAB Pharma) lebih lembut dan lebih sesuai untuk pengguna baru atau mereka yang sensitif terhadap perangsang.'),(4321,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_0_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4322,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_question_en','Are your products genuine?'),(4323,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4324,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_question_ms','Adakah produk anda asli?'),(4325,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4326,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_answer_en','Yes, 100% genuine. We only stock Modafinil from licensed pharmaceutical manufacturers regulated by international standards bodies. Each blister pack comes with manufacturer lot numbers and expiry dates.'),(4327,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4328,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_answer_ms','Ya, 100% asli. Kami hanya menyimpan Modafinil dari pengeluar farmaseutikal berlesen yang dikawal selia oleh badan piawaian antarabangsa. Setiap blister pack dilengkapi nombor lot dan tarikh luput pengeluar.'),(4329,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_1_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4330,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_question_en','What is the recommended dosage for beginners?'),(4331,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4332,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_question_ms','Apakah dos yang disyorkan untuk pemula?'),(4333,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4334,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_answer_en','New users should start with 100mg (half a 200mg tablet) to assess tolerance. After a few uses, many increase to a full 200mg dose. Take it early in the morning with or without food.'),(4335,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4336,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_answer_ms','Pengguna baru harus bermula dengan 100mg (setengah tablet 200mg) untuk menilai toleransi. Selepas beberapa penggunaan, ramai yang meningkat kepada dos penuh 200mg. Ambil pada awal pagi dengan atau tanpa makanan.'),(4337,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_2_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4338,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_question_en','How long do the effects of Modafinil last?'),(4339,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(4340,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_question_ms','Berapa lama kesan Modafinil bertahan?'),(4341,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(4342,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_answer_en','Modafinil usually lasts between 10-15 hours depending on individual metabolism and dose. 200mg Modafinil will provide sustained wakefulness and focus throughout the workday.'),(4343,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(4344,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_answer_ms','Modafinil biasanya bertahan antara 10-15 jam bergantung pada metabolisme individu dan dos. Modafinil 200mg akan memberikan keberjagaan dan fokus yang berterusan sepanjang hari kerja.'),(4345,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items_3_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(4346,667,'modules_0_faq_categories_3_items','4'),(4347,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories_3_items','field_faq_cat_items'),(4348,667,'modules_0_faq_categories','4'),(4349,667,'_modules_0_faq_categories','field_faq_categories'),(4350,645,'_edit_lock','1786467272:1'),(4351,680,'_wp_page_template','default'),(4352,680,'modules_0_title_en','Refund Policy & Guarantee'),(4353,680,'_modules_0_title_en','field_ref_d48a00dd46a3'),(4354,680,'modules_0_title_ms','Dasar Bayaran Balik'),(4355,680,'_modules_0_title_ms','field_ref_9ea1f8b69f70'),(4356,680,'modules_0_subtitle_en','If your order does not arrive, we will reship it for free or issue a full refund.'),(4357,680,'_modules_0_subtitle_en','field_ref_4524e00f098a'),(4358,680,'modules_0_subtitle_ms','Jika pesanan anda tidak sampai, kami hantar semula secara percuma atau kembalikan wang anda sepenuhnya.'),(4359,680,'_modules_0_subtitle_ms','field_ref_ec897aebf12a'),(4360,680,'modules_0_badges_0_badge_en','Free Reshipment'),(4361,680,'_modules_0_badges_0_badge_en','field_ref_33f9b6e9ef9b'),(4362,680,'modules_0_badges_0_badge_ms','Penghantaran Semula Percuma'),(4363,680,'_modules_0_badges_0_badge_ms','field_ref_cf560e9c3db0'),(4364,680,'modules_0_badges_1_badge_en','Full Refund Guarantee'),(4365,680,'_modules_0_badges_1_badge_en','field_ref_33f9b6e9ef9b'),(4366,680,'modules_0_badges_1_badge_ms','Bayaran Balik Penuh'),(4367,680,'_modules_0_badges_1_badge_ms','field_ref_cf560e9c3db0'),(4368,680,'modules_0_badges_2_badge_en','Customs Protection'),(4369,680,'_modules_0_badges_2_badge_en','field_ref_33f9b6e9ef9b'),(4370,680,'modules_0_badges_2_badge_ms','Perlindungan Kastam'),(4371,680,'_modules_0_badges_2_badge_ms','field_ref_cf560e9c3db0'),(4372,680,'modules_0_badges','3'),(4373,680,'_modules_0_badges','field_ref_4685c02287ac'),(4374,680,'modules_0_sections_0_title_en','Delivery Guarantee'),(4375,680,'_modules_0_sections_0_title_en','field_ref_a36a22a29c4f'),(4376,680,'modules_0_sections_0_title_ms','Jaminan Penghantaran'),(4377,680,'_modules_0_sections_0_title_ms','field_ref_d610844f8453'),(4378,680,'modules_0_sections_0_content_en','Every order is protected. If your package is lost in transit, damaged, or seized by Malaysian customs, we will reship your order at no extra cost — or issue a full refund if you prefer.'),(4379,680,'_modules_0_sections_0_content_en','field_ref_f8e7a5d6a302'),(4380,680,'modules_0_sections_0_content_ms','Jika pesanan anda tidak tiba dalam tempoh 25 hari bekerja (Semenanjung) atau 30 hari bekerja (Sabah/Sarawak) dari tarikh penghantaran, kami akan menghantar semula atau membuat bayaran balik sepenuhnya. Ini adalah jaminan kami kepada setiap pelanggan Malaysia.'),(4381,680,'_modules_0_sections_0_content_ms','field_ref_afca2eeb31cf'),(4382,680,'modules_0_sections_1_title_en','Customs Seizure'),(4383,680,'_modules_0_sections_1_title_en','field_ref_a36a22a29c4f'),(4384,680,'modules_0_sections_1_title_ms','Kehilangan di Kastam'),(4385,680,'_modules_0_sections_1_title_ms','field_ref_d610844f8453'),(4386,680,'modules_0_sections_1_content_en','In the rare event that your package is detained or confiscated by customs, we will reship your order free of charge. We maintain an exceptional delivery track record into Malaysia.'),(4387,680,'_modules_0_sections_1_content_en','field_ref_f8e7a5d6a302'),(4388,680,'modules_0_sections_1_content_ms','Dalam kes yang jarang berlaku di mana pesanan anda ditahan atau dirampas oleh pihak kastam, kami akan menghantar semula pesanan anda secara percuma. Kami mempunyai rekod penghantaran yang sangat baik ke Malaysia.'),(4389,680,'_modules_0_sections_1_content_ms','field_ref_afca2eeb31cf'),(4390,680,'modules_0_sections_2_title_en','Damaged or Wrong Products'),(4391,680,'_modules_0_sections_2_title_en','field_ref_a36a22a29c4f'),(4392,680,'modules_0_sections_2_title_ms','Produk Rosak atau Salah'),(4393,680,'_modules_0_sections_2_title_ms','field_ref_d610844f8453'),(4394,680,'modules_0_sections_2_content_en','If you receive a damaged or incorrect product, contact us within 7 days of receipt. We will send a replacement at no additional cost.'),(4395,680,'_modules_0_sections_2_content_en','field_ref_f8e7a5d6a302'),(4396,680,'modules_0_sections_2_content_ms','Jika anda menerima produk yang rosak atau bukan yang anda pesan, hubungi kami dalam masa 7 hari dari tarikh penerimaan. Kami akan menghantar penggantian tanpa sebarang kos tambahan.'),(4397,680,'_modules_0_sections_2_content_ms','field_ref_afca2eeb31cf'),(4398,680,'modules_0_sections_3_title_en','Non-Eligible Products / Cases'),(4399,680,'_modules_0_sections_3_title_en','field_ref_a36a22a29c4f'),(4400,680,'modules_0_sections_3_title_ms','Produk Tidak Layak untuk Bayaran Balik'),(4401,680,'_modules_0_sections_3_title_ms','field_ref_d610844f8453'),(4402,680,'modules_0_sections_3_content_en','• Products that have been opened or used.\n• Orders with incorrect delivery addresses provided by customer error.\n• Change of mind after the order has been processed.'),(4403,680,'_modules_0_sections_3_content_en','field_ref_f8e7a5d6a302'),(4404,680,'modules_0_sections_3_content_ms','• Produk yang telah dibuka atau digunakan.\n• Pesanan dengan alamat penghantaran yang salah disebabkan kesilapan pelanggan.\n• Perubahan fikiran selepas pesanan diproses.'),(4405,680,'_modules_0_sections_3_content_ms','field_ref_afca2eeb31cf'),(4406,680,'modules_0_sections_4_title_en','How to Make a Claim'),(4407,680,'_modules_0_sections_4_title_en','field_ref_a36a22a29c4f'),(4408,680,'modules_0_sections_4_title_ms','Cara Membuat Tuntutan'),(4409,680,'_modules_0_sections_4_title_ms','field_ref_d610844f8453'),(4410,680,'modules_0_sections_4_content_en','Contact us via WhatsApp (+60 11-1628 4532) or email with your order number. We will process your claim within 2-3 business days.'),(4411,680,'_modules_0_sections_4_content_en','field_ref_f8e7a5d6a302'),(4412,680,'modules_0_sections_4_content_ms','Hubungi kami melalui WhatsApp (+60 11-1628 4532) atau emel dengan nombor pesanan anda. Kami akan memproses tuntutan dalam masa 2-3 hari bekerja.'),(4413,680,'_modules_0_sections_4_content_ms','field_ref_afca2eeb31cf'),(4414,680,'modules_0_sections','5'),(4415,680,'_modules_0_sections','field_ref_a3e48e910eee'),(4416,680,'_modules_layout_meta','a:2:{s:8:\"disabled\";a:0:{}s:7:\"renamed\";a:0:{}}'),(4417,680,'modules','a:1:{i:0;s:13:\"refund_policy\";}'),(4418,680,'_modules','field_modules'),(4419,643,'_title_en','Modafinil Guide for KL and Klang Valley Professionals'),(4420,643,'_title_ms','Panduan Modafinil untuk Profesional KL dan Lembah Klang'),(4421,643,'_excerpt_en','How corporate professionals in Kuala Lumpur — managers, engineers, lawyers, and entrepreneurs — use Modafinil to stay competitive.'),(4422,643,'_excerpt_ms','How corporate professionals in Kuala Lumpur — managers, engineers, lawyers, and entrepreneurs — use Modafinil to stay competitive.'),(4423,643,'_category_en','Use Cases'),(4424,643,'_category_ms','Penggunaan'),(4425,645,'_title_en','Customs Guide: Importing Modafinil into Malaysia'),(4426,645,'_title_ms','Panduan Kastam: Import Modafinil ke Malaysia'),(4427,645,'_excerpt_en','What happens when Modafinil goes th