J Seksyen 14 dengan cepat. Pembungkusan yang diskret sangat bagus. Sangat membantu dengan beban kerja syarikat permulaan saya.'),(5864,715,'_reviews_0_text_ms','rev_tms_9a1e8e61764d'),(5865,715,'reviews_1_author','Daniel L.'),(5866,715,'_reviews_1_author','rev_auth_bd7dc0a3a5b6'),(5867,715,'reviews_1_rating','5'),(5868,715,'_reviews_1_rating','rev_rat_609f0be1d61e'),(5869,715,'reviews_1_date_en','January 2026'),(5870,715,'_reviews_1_date_en','rev_den_e6cd4be66efd'),(5871,715,'reviews_1_date_ms','Januari 2026'),(5872,715,'_reviews_1_date_ms','rev_dms_9648d02eff19'),(5873,715,'reviews_1_text_en','Excellent customer service and reliable shipping to Sunway area. Will be buying again.'),(5874,715,'_reviews_1_text_en','rev_ten_753d322f0a1a'),(5875,715,'reviews_1_text_ms','Perkhidmatan pelanggan yang sangat baik dan penghantaran yang boleh dipercayai ke kawasan Sunway. Akan beli lagi.'),(5876,715,'_reviews_1_text_ms','rev_tms_9a1e8e61764d'),(5877,715,'reviews','2'),(5878,715,'_reviews','field_city_56c16bc341bd'),(5879,716,'city_name','Shah Alam'),(5880,716,'_city_name','field_city_4e700465560a'),(5881,716,'region','Selangor'),(5882,716,'_region','field_city_180016246c8e'),(5883,716,'population','680K Penduduk'),(5884,716,'_population','field_city_c2c1a0bb0b2d'),(5885,716,'delivery_days','7-12'),(5886,716,'_delivery_days','field_city_927abea3e5cd'),(5887,716,'demographic_en','UiTM students during exams'),(5888,716,'_demographic_en','field_city_11ce776de785'),(5889,716,'demographic_ms','pelajar UiTM semasa musim peperiksaan'),(5890,716,'_demographic_ms','field_city_f36ad4dd710d'),(5891,716,'industry_en','industrial workers and professionals'),(5892,716,'_industry_en','field_city_1d15e28c9f77'),(5893,716,'industry_ms','pekerja industri dan profesional'),(5894,716,'_industry_ms','field_city_98df291962f3'),(5895,716,'hero_desc_en','Shah Alam is Selangor\'s state capital and a major industrial and educational hub. Pos Malaysia delivers to all areas in Shah Alam within 7-12 working days.'),(5896,716,'_hero_desc_en','field_city_3fb43d17d5cb'),(5897,716,'hero_desc_ms','Shah Alam ialah ibu negeri Selangor dan hab perindustrian serta pendidikan utama. Pos Malaysia menghantar ke semua kawasan Shah Alam dalam masa 7-12 hari bekerja.'),(5898,716,'_hero_desc_ms','field_city_44d647761d90'),(5899,716,'desc_en','Shah Alam is Selangor\'s state capital and a major industrial and educational hub. Home to UiTM — Malaysia\'s largest university — and vast industrial zones, Shah Alam\'s population spans students, factory managers, engineers, and government professionals. Modafinil is popular among UiTM students during exam periods and Shah Alam\'s shift workers managing demanding industrial schedules.'),(5900,716,'_desc_en','field_city_2b8834e47af2'),(5901,716,'desc_ms','Shah Alam ialah ibu negeri Selangor dan hab perindustrian serta pendidikan utama. Menjadi tumpuan UiTM — universiti terbesar di Malaysia — dan zon perindustrian yang luas, populasi Shah Alam merangkumi pelajar, pengurus kilang, jurutera, dan profesional kerajaan. Modafinil popular dalam kalangan pelajar UiTM semasa musim peperiksaan dan pekerja syif di Shah Alam yang menguruskan jadual industri yang padat.'),(5902,716,'_desc_ms','field_city_123737155c17'),(5903,716,'features_0_feat_en','Fast delivery to Shah Alam and all sections'),(5904,716,'_features_0_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(5905,716,'features_0_feat_ms','Penghantaran pantas ke Shah Alam dan semua seksyen'),(5906,716,'_features_0_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(5907,716,'features_1_feat_en','Popular with UiTM students during exams'),(5908,716,'_features_1_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(5909,716,'features_1_feat_ms','Popular dalam kalangan pelajar UiTM semasa peperiksaan'),(5910,716,'_features_1_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(5911,716,'features_2_feat_en','Serves industrial workers and professionals'),(5912,716,'_features_2_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(5913,716,'features_2_feat_ms','Berkhidmat untuk pekerja industri 