Home to a booming startup ecosystem, the Batu Kawan industrial zone, and Universiti Sains Malaysia, George Town\'s ambitious professionals and students are always looking for a cognitive edge. The city\'s mix of heritage culture and modern industry makes it one of Malaysia\'s most dynamic places to work.'),(6104,719,'_desc_en','field_city_2b8834e47af2'),(6105,719,'desc_ms','George Town ialah nadi Pulau Pinang — bandar Tapak Warisan Dunia UNESCO dan hab teknologi serta kreatif paling meriah di Malaysia. Menjadi tumpuan ekosistem syarikat permulaan yang pesat berkembang, zon perindustrian Batu Kawan, dan Universiti Sains Malaysia, golongan profesional dan pelajar yang bercita-cita tinggi di George Town sentiasa mencari kelebihan kognitif. Gabungan budaya warisan dan industri moden di bandar ini menjadikannya salah satu tempat paling dinamik di Malaysia untuk bekerja.'),(6106,719,'_desc_ms','field_city_123737155c17'),(6107,719,'features_0_feat_en','Fast delivery to George Town and all Penang postcodes'),(6108,719,'_features_0_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6109,719,'features_0_feat_ms','Penghantaran pantas ke George Town dan semua poskod Pulau Pinang'),(6110,719,'_features_0_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6111,719,'features_1_feat_en','Popular with tech workers and startup founders'),(6112,719,'_features_1_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6113,719,'features_1_feat_ms','Popular dalam kalangan pekerja teknologi dan pengasas syarikat permulaan'),(6114,719,'_features_1_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6115,719,'features_2_feat_en','Trusted by USM and university students'),(6116,719,'_features_2_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6117,719,'features_2_feat_ms','Dipercayai oleh pelajar USM dan universiti'),(6118,719,'_features_2_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6119,719,'features_3_feat_en','Discreet Pos Malaysia tracked delivery'),(6120,719,'_features_3_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6121,719,'features_3_feat_ms','Penghantaran berjejak Pos Malaysia yang diskret'),