ional yang mencari gabungan sempurna antara kerjaya dan gaya hidup. Modafinil popular dalam kalangan pekerja bebas, pemilik perniagaan, dan pekerja syif di sektor penjagaan kesihatan serta pembuatan di Ipoh.'),(6174,720,'_desc_ms','field_city_123737155c17'),(6175,720,'features_0_feat_en','Fast delivery to all Ipoh postcodes'),(6176,720,'_features_0_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6177,720,'features_0_feat_ms','Penghantaran pantas ke semua poskod Ipoh'),(6178,720,'_features_0_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6179,720,'features_1_feat_en','Popular with remote workers and entrepreneurs'),(6180,720,'_features_1_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6181,720,'features_1_feat_ms','Popular dalam kalangan pekerja jarak jauh dan usahawan'),(6182,720,'_features_1_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6183,720,'features_2_feat_en','Serves healthcare and manufacturing professionals'),(6184,720,'_features_2_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6185,720,'features_2_feat_ms','Berkhidmat untuk profesional penjagaan kesihatan dan pembuatan'),(6186,720,'_features_2_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6187,720,'features_3_feat_en','Reliable Pos Malaysia tracked delivery'),(6188,720,'_features_3_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6189,720,'features_3_feat_ms','Penghantaran berjejak Pos Malaysia yang boleh dipercayai'),(6190,720,'_features_3_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6191,720,'features','4'),(6192,720,'_features','field_city_b906e20f51a5'),(6193,720,'reviews_0_author','Ramesh S.'),(6194,720,'_reviews_0_author','rev_auth_bd7dc0a3a5b6'),(6195,720,'reviews_0_rating','5'),(6196,720,'_reviews_0_rating','rev_rat_609f0be1d61e'),(6197,720,'reviews_0_date_en','December 2025'),(6198,720,'_reviews_0_date_en','rev_den_e6cd4be66efd'),(6199,720,'reviews_0_date_ms','Disember 2025'),(6200,720,'_reviews_0_date_ms','rev_dms_9648d02eff19'),(6201,720,'reviews_0_text_en','I work remotely in Ipoh and the productivity boost is unmatched. Delivery was smooth via Pos Malaysia.'),(6202,720,'_reviews_0_text_en','rev