rs to all areas in Kota Kinabalu within 10-16 working days.'),(6236,721,'_hero_desc_en','field_city_3fb43d17d5cb'),(6237,721,'hero_desc_ms','Kota Kinabalu ialah ibu negeri Sabah dan pintu gerbang ke keajaiban alam semula jadi Borneo. Pos Malaysia menghantar ke semua kawasan Kota Kinabalu dalam masa 10-16 hari bekerja.'),(6238,721,'_hero_desc_ms','field_city_44d647761d90'),(6239,721,'desc_en','Kota Kinabalu is Sabah\'s capital and the gateway to Borneo\'s natural wonders. Beyond tourism, KK is home to Universiti Malaysia Sabah (UMS), a thriving oil and gas sector, and government services. Modafinil is now delivered reliably to all Sabah postcodes, giving East Malaysians access to quality cognitive supplements.'),(6240,721,'_desc_en','field_city_2b8834e47af2'),(6241,721,'desc_ms','Kota Kinabalu ialah ibu negeri Sabah dan pintu gerbang ke keajaiban alam semula jadi Borneo. Di luar sektor pelancongan, KK merupakan pusat bagi Universiti Malaysia Sabah (UMS), sektor minyak dan gas yang berkembang pesat, dan perkhidmatan kerajaan. Modafinil kini dihantar dengan pasti ke semua poskod Sabah, memberi akses kepada rakyat Malaysia Timur terhadap suplemen kognitif yang berkualiti.'),(6242,721,'_desc_ms','field_city_123737155c17'),(6243,721,'features_0_feat_en','Pos Malaysia delivery to all Sabah postcodes'),(6244,721,'_features_0_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6245,721,'features_0_feat_ms','Penghantaran Pos Malaysia ke semua poskod Sabah'),(6246,721,'_features_0_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6247,721,'features_1_feat_en','Popular with oil and gas workers and UMS students'),(6248,721,'_features_1_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6249,721,'features_1_feat_ms','Popular dalam kalangan pekerja minyak dan gas serta pelajar UMS'),(6250,721,'_features_1_feat_ms','feat_ms_bec0a1370a0e'),(6251,721,'features_2_feat_en','Serves government and healthcare professionals'),(6252,721,'_features_2_feat_en','feat_en_226dcea21a96'),(6253,721,'features_2_feat_ms','Berkhidmat untuk profesiona