elanjawan'),(6856,729,'_modules_0_product_cards_3_use_ms','field_dsg_9707b14d07'),(6857,729,'modules_0_product_cards_3_dose','150mg'),(6858,729,'_modules_0_product_cards_3_dose','field_dsg_8b879d706d'),(6859,729,'modules_0_product_cards_3_duration','8–12h'),(6860,729,'_modules_0_product_cards_3_duration','field_dsg_39713e496e'),(6861,729,'modules_0_product_cards_3_link','/product/artvigil-150/'),(6862,729,'_modules_0_product_cards_3_link','field_dsg_d6b8a2e880'),(6863,729,'modules_0_product_cards','4'),(6864,729,'_modules_0_product_cards','field_dsg_c5ad7251dc'),(6865,729,'modules_0_faq_items_0_q_en','What happens if I miss a dose?'),(6866,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_0_q_en','field_dsg_3718ef24da'),(6867,729,'modules_0_faq_items_0_q_ms','Apa yang berlaku jika saya terlepas dos?'),(6868,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_0_q_ms','field_dsg_1aa4146200'),(6869,729,'modules_0_faq_items_0_a_en','Simply skip it and continue the next planned day. Do not double your dose.'),(6870,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_0_a_en','field_dsg_0264c9a81f'),(6871,729,'modules_0_faq_items_0_a_ms','Abaikan sahaja dan teruskan pada hari yang dijadualkan seterusnya. Jangan gandakan dos anda.'),(6872,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_0_a_ms','field_dsg_2430f44e42'),(6873,729,'modules_0_faq_items_1_q_en','Can I take Modafinil every day?'),(6874,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_1_q_en','field_dsg_3718ef24da'),(6875,729,'modules_0_faq_items_1_q_ms','Bolehkah saya mengambil Modafinil setiap hari?'),(6876,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_1_q_ms','field_dsg_1aa4146200'),(6877,729,'modules_0_faq_items_1_a_en','Most users take it 2–3 times per week to avoid tolerance build-up. Daily use is possible but tolerance management is important.'),(6878,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_1_a_en','field_dsg_0264c9a81f'),(6879,729,'modules_0_faq_items_1_a_ms','Kebanyakan pengguna mengambilnya 2-3 kali seminggu untuk mengelakkan pembinaan toleransi. Penggunaan harian adalah mungkin tetapi pengurusan toleransi adalah penting.'),(6880,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_1_a_ms','field_dsg_2430f44e42'),(6881,729,'modules_0_faq_items_2_q_en','Should I take it with food or on an empty stomach?'),(6882,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_2_q_en','field_dsg_3718ef24da'),(6883,729,'modules_0_faq_items_2_q_ms','Adakah perlu mengambilnya bersama makanan atau perut kosong?'),(6884,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_2_q_ms','field_dsg_1aa4146200'),(6885,729,'modules_0_faq_items_2_a_en','Both work. Taking it with a light meal can reduce the chance of nausea for new users. Fatty food may delay onset slightly.'),(6886,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_2_a_en','field_dsg_0264c9a81f'),(6887,729,'modules_0_faq_items_2_a_ms','Kedua-duanya berkesan. Mengambilnya dengan makanan ringan boleh mengurangkan loya untuk pengguna baru. Makanan berlemak mungkin melambatkan permulaan sedikit.'),(6888,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_2_a_ms','field_dsg_2430f44e42'),(6889,729,'modules_0_faq_items_3_q_en','Why does Modafinil make me less thirsty in Malaysia\'s heat?'),(6890,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_3_q_en','field_dsg_3718ef24da'),(6891,729,'modules_0_faq_items_3_q_ms','Mengapa Modafinil menjadikan saya kurang dahaga dalam cuaca panas Malaysia?'),(6892,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_3_q_ms','field_dsg_1aa4146200'),(6893,729,'modules_0_faq_items_3_a_en','Modafinil can suppress the thirst response. Combined with Malaysia\'s tropical heat, dehydration is a real risk. Set phone reminders to drink water regularly.'),(6894,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_3_a_en','field_dsg_0264c9a81f'),(6895,729,'modules_0_faq_items_3_a_ms','Modafinil boleh menekan tindak balas dahaga. Digabungkan dengan haba tropika Malaysia, dehidrasi adalah risiko sebenar. Tetapkan peringatan telefon untuk minum air secara berkala.'),(6896,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_3_a_ms','field_dsg_2430f44e42'),(6897,729,'modules_0_faq_items_4_q_en','Is 200mg too much for a first-time user?'),(6898,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_4_q_en','field_dsg_3718ef24da'),(6899,729,'modules_0_faq_items_4_q_ms','Adakah 200mg terlalu banyak untuk pengguna kali pertama?'),(6900,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_4_q_ms','field_dsg_1aa4146200'),(6901,729,'modules_0_faq_items_4_a_en','It can be. Many experienced users recommend starting with 100mg for your first 2–3 uses to gauge your response before moving to the full dose.'),(6902,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_4_a_en','field_dsg_0264c9a81f'),(6903,729,'modules_0_faq_items_4_a_ms','Boleh jadi. Ramai pengguna berpengalaman mengesyorkan bermula dengan 100mg untuk 2-3 penggunaan pertama anda untuk menilai tindak balas sebelum beralih ke dos penuh.'),(6904,729,'_modules_0_faq_items_4_a_ms','field_dsg_2430f44e42'),(6905,729,'modules_0_faq_items','5'),(6906,729,'_modules_0_faq_items','field_dsg_ff966795a6'),(6907,729,'_modules_layout_meta','a:2:{s:8:\"disabled\";a:0:{}s:7:\"renamed\";a:0:{}}'),(6908,729,'modules','a:1:{i:0;s:12:\"dosage_guide\";}'),(6909,729,'_modules','field_modules'),(6910,729,'_edit_lock','1786469713:1'),(6911,729,'modules_0_page_badge_en','Dosage Guide'),(6912,729,'_modules_0_page_badge_en','field_dsg_23787a24fc'),(6913,729,'modules_0_page_badge_ms','Panduan Dos'),(6914,729,'_modules_0_page_badge_ms','field_dsg_317c40f54a'),(6915,729,'modules_0_page_title_en','Modafinil Dosage Guide for Malaysian Users'),(6916,729,'_modules_0_page_title_en','field_dsg_c3e8d94a1d'),(6917,729,'modules_0_page_title_ms','Panduan Dos Modafinil untuk Pengguna Malaysia'),(6918,729,'_modules_0_page_title_ms','field_dsg_eaf9eb6854'),(6919,729,'modules_0_page_subtitle_en','The optimal dosage, best time to take it, and tips specific to Malaysia\'s hot and humid climate.'),(6920,729,'_modules_0_page_subtitle_en','field_dsg_304d43d200'),(6921,729,'modules_0_page_subtitle_ms','Dos yang optimum, masa terbaik untuk mengambilnya, dan petua khusus untuk keadaan cuaca Malaysia.'),(6922,729,'_modules_0_page_subtitle_ms','field_dsg_a7bb473e51'),(6923,729,'modules_0_disclaimer_en','This information is for educational purposes only. Please consult a licensed doctor before using Modafinil. This is not medical advice.'),(6924,72