laysia takes 7-12 working days for Peninsular Malaysia and 10-16 days for Sabah and Sarawak. Every order comes with a tracking number.'),(7328,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_1_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(7329,737,'modules_8_faq_items_1_answer_ms','Penghantaran via Pos Malaysia mengambil 7-12 hari bekerja untuk Semenanjung Malaysia dan 10-16 hari untuk Sabah dan Sarawak. Setiap pesanan dilengkapi nombor penjejakan.'),(7330,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_1_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(7331,737,'modules_8_faq_items_2_question_en','What are the currencies and payment methods?'),(7332,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_2_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(7333,737,'modules_8_faq_items_2_question_ms','Apakah mata wang dan kaedah pembayaran?'),(7334,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_2_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(7335,737,'modules_8_faq_items_2_answer_en','We accept Malaysian Ringgit (RM). Payment is made via bank transfer or FPX. Once payment is confirmed, your order will be processed within 24 hours.'),(7336,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_2_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(7337,737,'modules_8_faq_items_2_answer_ms','Kami menerima Ringgit Malaysia (RM). Pembayaran dibuat melalui pindahan bank atau FPX. Selepas pembayaran disahkan, pesanan anda akan diproses dalam masa 24 jam.'),(7338,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_2_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(7339,737,'modules_8_faq_items_3_question_en','Is your packaging discreet?'),(7340,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_3_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(7341,737,'modules_8_faq_items_3_question_ms','Adakah pembungkusan anda diskret?'),(7342,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_3_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(7343,737,'modules_8_faq_items_3_answer_en','Yes, completely. All orders are shipped in plain boxes without any branding, product names, or identifying information.'),(7344,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_3_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(7345,737,'modules_8_faq_items_3_answer_ms','Ya, sepenuhnya. Semua pesanan dihantar dalam kotak biasa tanpa sebarang jenama, nama produk, atau maklumat yang boleh mengenal pasti kandungannya.'),(7346,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_3_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(7347,737,'modules_8_faq_items_4_question_en','What is the limit for free shipping?'),(7348,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_4_question_en','field_faq_q_en'),(7349,737,'modules_8_faq_items_4_question_ms','Berapa had penghantaran percuma?'),(7350,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_4_question_ms','field_faq_q_ms'),(7351,737,'modules_8_faq_items_4_answer_en','Free shipping via Pos Malaysia for all orders RM399 and above. Orders below RM399 are subject to a reasonable shipping fee.'),(7352,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_4_answer_en','field_faq_a_en'),(7353,737,'modules_8_faq_items_4_answer_ms','Penghantaran percuma via Pos Malaysia untuk semua pesanan RM399 ke atas. Pesanan di bawah RM399 dikenakan caj penghantaran yang berpatutan.'),(7354,737,'_modules_8_faq_items_4_answer_ms','field_faq_a_ms'),(7355,737,'modules_8_faq_items','5'),(7356,737,'_modules_8_faq_items','field_faq_items'),(7357,737,'modules_8_show_full_faq_link','1'),(7358,737,'_modules_8_show_full_faq_link','field_faq_show_link'),(7359,737,'modules_8_link_text_en','Full FAQ'),(7360,737,'_modules_8_link_text_en','field_faq_link_en'),(7361,737,'modules_8_link_text_ms','Soalan Lazim Penuh'),(7362,737,'_modules_8_link_text_ms','field_faq_link_ms'),(7363,737,'modules_8_link_url','/faq'),(7364,737,'_modules_8_link_url','field_faq_link_url'),(7365,737,'_title_ms','Laman utama'),(7366,737,'__title_ms','field_title_ms'),(7367,737,'_excerpt_ms',''),(7368,737,'__excerpt_ms','field_excerpt_ms'),(7369,737,'_category_ms',''),(7370,737,'__category_ms','field_category_ms'),(7371,737,'_content_ms',''),(7372,737,'__content_ms','field_content_ms'),(7373,737,'modules_3_products',''),(7374,737,'_modules_3_products','field_fp_products'),(7375,737,'modules_4_cities',''),(7376,737,'_modules_4_cities','field_dc_cities'),(7377,737,'modules_7_reviews',''),(7378,737,'_modules_7_reviews','field_rc_reviews'),(7379,738,'_menu_item_type','custom'),(7380,738,'_m