eh diambil sebagai dos harian penuh atau dibelah untuk dos 50mg yang lebih ringan mengikut keperluan.</li>\n  <li><strong>Tempoh tindakan 6–8 jam:</strong> Lebih pendek berbanding dos 200mg, sesuai untuk separuh hari kerja atau sesi belajar petang.</li>\n  <li><strong>Popular di kalangan:</strong> Pelajar universiti (UiTM, Sunway, Taylor\'s), penulis konten, guru tuisyen, dan profesional kreatif di seluruh Malaysia.</li>\n  <li><strong>Penghantaran Malaysia:</strong> Via Pos Malaysia ke seluruh negara. Semenanjung: 7–12 hari bekerja.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Modalert 100mg by Sun Pharma is the preferred starting dose for new Modafinil users in Malaysia. Provides clean focus and wakefulness without the full intensity of the 200mg dose. Great for students, creatives, and professionals across KL, Penang, and Johor who need a lighter cognitive edge. Buy Modafinil Malaysia at a lower dose — genuine Sun Pharma product, discreet Pos Malaysia delivery.</p>','publish','open','closed','','modalert-100mg','','','2026-08-10 22:59:20','2026-08-10 14:59:20','',0,'http://modafinil-malaysia.test/product/modalert-100mg/',0,'product','',0),(514,0,'2026-08-10 21:46:54','2026-08-10 13:46:54','','Modalert 100mg - 10 Tabs','pa_quantity: 10 Tabs','publish','closed','closed','','modalert-100mg-10-tabs','','','2026-08-10 21:46:54','2026-08-10 13:46:54','',513,'http://modafinil-malaysia.test/?post_type=product_variation&p=514',0,'product_variation','',0),(515,0,'2026-08-10 21:46:54','2026-08-10 13:46:54','','Modalert 100mg - 30 Tabs','pa_quantity: 30 Tabs','publish','closed','closed','','modalert-100mg-30-tabs','','','2026-08-10 21:46:54','2026-08-10 13:46:54','',513,'http://modafinil-malaysia.test/?post_type=product_variation&p=515',0,'product_variation','',0),(516,0,'2026-08-10 21:46:54','2026-08-10 13:46:54','','Modalert 100mg - 100 Tabs','pa_quantity: 50 Tabs','publish','closed','closed','','modalert-100mg-50-tabs','','','2026-08-10 21:46:54','2026-08-10 13:46:54','',513,'http://modafinil-malay